      "description": "<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"764\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"764\">Diana Ross – Why Do Fools Fall In Love / Think I'm In Love</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"904\">Original 1981 RCA Records 7-inch 45 RPM single featuring the title track from Diana Ross's successful album <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"903\">Why Do Fools Fall in Love</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"972\">A great addition for Motown, soul, pop, and Diana Ross collectors.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"977\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j02m21\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"997\">Record Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fudm5h\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1019\">\nArtist: Diana Ross\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qljh7a\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1054\">\nTitle: Why Do Fools Fall In Love\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibue6a\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1082\">\nB-Side: Think I'm In Love\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m0mmuy\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1103\">\nLabel: RCA Records\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xm3j7k\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1130\">\nCatalog Number: PB-12349\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8imy\" data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1156\">\nFormat: 7\" Vinyl Single\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r3wzuj\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1172\">\nSpeed: 45 RPM\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10vwi65\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1187\">\nCountry: USA\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lzrz24\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1200\">\nYear: 1981\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17si63v\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1224\">Track Listing</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1236\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1236\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1271\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1k5qeo\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1271\">\nWhy Do Fools Fall In Love – 2:52\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1283\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1283\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<li data-section-id=\"18enesz\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1310\">\nThink I'm In Love – 4:13\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1329\">Condition</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1344\"><strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1341\">Vinyl:</strong> VG</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1491\">\n<li data-section-id=\"o86976\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1425\">\nGood shine with light scratches and handling marks visible under bright light.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11nkcui\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1469\">\nLabels remain clean with only minor wear.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kaqi1c\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1491\">\nNo cracks or chips.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1504\"><strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1504\">Sleeve:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1577\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1613scd\" data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1577\">\nShips in a new white paper sleeve with a protective poly outer sleeve.</li></ul>",
